Rāma notes throbbing eye stumbling and trembling --- Rāma finds dwelling empty and disturbed --- Rāma laments Sītā stolen dead hidden or fled --- Rāma questions kadamba bilva arjuna and aśōka --- Rāma questions deer elephant tiger for beloved --- Rāma begs hiding Sītā to stop mocking him --- Rāma imagines Rākṣasas devoured her tender limbs --- Rāma runs forest to forest crying for beloved